,"default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666705648,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA1NjQ4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:animation","name":"topic:animation","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-08-19T08:32:30Z","updated_at":"2026-08-19T15:28:20Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nv4.7.1.stable.official [a13da4feb]\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.7.1.stable - Windows 11 (build 26200) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Direct3D 12 (Mobile) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1650 with Max-Q Design (NVIDIA; 31.0.15.3892) - Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-1065G7 CPU @ 1.30GHz (8 threads) - 31.59 GiB memory - WASAPI (48000 Hz, Stereo/mono)\n\n### Issue description\n\nIn the Bezier curve editor, when you select multiple keys using a rectangular selection, if a key overlaps with a Bezier handle, dragging will move the Bezier handle for that keys rather than the keys itself. (there is a very small area where keys dragging is possible.)\n\nThis issue does not occur when selecting a single key.\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Open MRP node_2d.tscn.\n2. Open Animation Dock and select new_animation.\n3. Select 2 keys at Time: 1.0 by rectangle selection.\n4. Drag 2 keys (but it moves Bezier handle).\n\nBezier handles overlap the key.\n<img width=\"512\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/138fa006-b143-4926-a1f7-09ed90ca1cdc\" />\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[mrp_bezier_multi_key_drag.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/31214324/mrp_bezier_multi_key_drag.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122583/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122583/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}